\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        '200'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          content</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            application/json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              schema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">object</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                required</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">semantics_version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">items</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                properties</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                  semantics_version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                  items</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                    type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">array</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                    items</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                      type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">object</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                      required</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">aspect_l2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">n_eff</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">suppressed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                      properties</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                        aspect_l2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                        neg_rate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">nullable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                        ci_low</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">nullable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                        ci_high</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">nullable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                        n_eff</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">integer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                        suppressed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                        suppression_reason</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">nullable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>semantics_version</code> 是最容易被省略、又最不该省略的字段。它标识这一批数字背后的语义层版本（方面词表 + 模型 + 聚合口径的组合）。调用方把它记录下来，就能在数字发生跳变时第一时间分辨是业务变化还是口径变化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分位数与聚合的工程细节\">分位数与聚合的工程细节</h2><h3 id=\"cont-与-disc-的语义差异\">cont 与 disc 的语义差异</h3><p>洞察报表里大量使用分位数：商家在同类目里的分位、方面负面率的 P90、响应时长中位数。分位数在 SQL 层有两种实现，语义不同，选错会造成难以察觉的偏差。</p>\n<p>PostgreSQL 的 <code>percentile_cont</code> 是连续分位，必要时在相邻值之间插值，可能返回数据集中不存在的值；<code>percentile_disc</code> 返回排序后位置达到或超过指定比例的第一个实际值。两者都用 <code>WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY ...)</code> 调用，且要求分数在 0 到 1 之间，否则报错（见 <a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/functions-aggregate.html\">PostgreSQL 聚合函数文档</a>）。</p>\n<p>选择规则：需要与业务口径上的「典型值」一致时用 <code>percentile_disc</code>（它返回的一定是真实存在的值，商家能对上号）；需要数学性质稳定、参与后续计算时用 <code>percentile_cont</code>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分位数不可跨实例平均\">分位数不可跨实例平均</h3><p>监控指标的分位数聚合还有一层陷阱：<strong>分位数不可跨实例平均</strong>。把十个分区的 P95 加起来除以十是错的，必须把原始观测聚合成直方图再算分位数。这与 Prometheus 在直方图与摘要之间的取舍完全一致——摘要（summary）在应用内计算预先选定的分位数，准确但不可跨实例聚合；直方图记录桶计数，分位数在服务端计算，可以聚合（见 <a href=\"https://prometheus.io/docs/practices/histograms/\">Prometheus 直方图实践</a>）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 商家在同类目中的分位：用 disc 保证返回真实商家对应值&#10;with shop_rate as (&#10;  select s.shop_id, s.leaf_category,&#10;         count(*) filter (where a.sentiment_score &lt; 0)::numeric / nullif(count(*), 0) as neg_rate,&#10;         count(*) as n&#10;  from insight.aspect_instance a&#10;  join dim.shop s on s.shop_id = a.shop_id&#10;  where a.ts &gt;= current_date - interval &#39;90 days&#39;&#10;  group by 1, 2&#10;  having count(*) &gt;= 30&#10;)&#10;select shop_id, leaf_category, neg_rate,&#10;       percentile_disc(0.5) within group (order by neg_rate)&#10;         over (partition by leaf_category) as category_median,&#10;       cume_dist() over (partition by leaf_category order by neg_rate) as pct_rank&#10;from shop_rate;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 商家在同类目中的分位：用 disc 保证返回真实商家对应值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shop_rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  select</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">shop_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">leaf_category</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">where</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sentiment_score</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nullif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> neg_rate,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  from</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> insight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">aspect_instance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  join</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dim</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">shop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">on</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">shop_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">shop_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  where</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'90 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  group by</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  having</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shop_id, leaf_category, neg_rate,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       percentile_disc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">within</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> group</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">order by</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> neg_rate)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         over</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">partition</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> by</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> leaf_category) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> category_median,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       cume_dist</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">over</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">partition</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> by</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> leaf_category </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">order by</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> neg_rate) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pct_rank</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shop_rate;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>cume_dist()</code> 给出的是「小于等于当前值的比例」，即分位排名，比直接算名次更稳健——它对并列值处理正确，也不会因类目商家总数变化而跳变。</p>\n<h2 id=\"上游变更的血缘追踪\">上游变更的血缘追踪</h2><h3 id=\"用-openlineage-建模血缘\">用 OpenLineage 建模血缘</h3><p>洞察服务的输出质量完全取决于上游管线，因此必须能回答「这个数字是哪一版模型、哪一版词表、哪次数据快照算出来的」。上游的语义层版本来自 <a href=\"../aspect-sentiment-mining/aspect-extraction-taxonomy\">评价方面抽取与品类方面词表</a> 与 <a href=\"../aspect-sentiment-mining/sentiment-aspect-score\">方面级情感打分与聚合</a>，披露侧的抑制规则来自 <a href=\"insight-privacy-aggregate\">分析合规与聚合匿名化</a>。这个血缘能力属于数据血缘范畴，可以借用现成的开放标准建模。</p>\n<p>OpenLineage 定义了三种事件：<code>RunEvent</code> 描述一次运行的状态变化（通常从 START 到 COMPLETE），<code>JobEvent</code> 与 <code>DatasetEvent</code> 描述设计期的静态元数据。<code>RunEvent</code> 携带 run 状态、时间戳、job、run（客户端生成的 UUID，推荐 UUIDv7）、输入数据集、输出数据集，以及可扩展的 facets（见 <a href=\"https://openlineage.io/docs/spec/object-model/\">OpenLineage 对象模型</a>）。洞察管线完全可以按这个模型发射事件，把「方面实例表 → 聚合表 → 服务版本」这条链记录下来。</p>\n<h3 id=\"版本演进的兼容判断\">版本演进的兼容判断</h3><p>工程收益有三个：口径变更时能算出受影响的 SKU 与商家范围；线上数字异常时能快速定位是哪一段上游变了；对外服务能够提供「本数据的生成时间与模型版本」这类透明度信息。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变更类型</th>\n<th>是否破坏兼容</th>\n<th>处理方式</th>\n<th>调用方通知</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>新增可选字段</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>直接上线</td>\n<td>变更日志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新增枚举值</td>\n<td>视情况</td>\n<td>加 <code>unknown</code> 兜底</td>\n<td>变更日志 + 提前告知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字段含义变化</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>新端点 + 新版本号</td>\n<td>必须提前通知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型版本升级</td>\n<td>视情况</td>\n<td>新 <code>semantics_version</code></td>\n<td>必须提前通知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抑制阈值调整</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>新版本号</td>\n<td>必须提前通知</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「模型版本升级」列为视情况，是因为它是否破坏兼容取决于调用方怎么用。如果调用方只消费趋势，一个平滑的语义漂移可能无感；如果调用方按绝对阈值触发动作，同样的漂移会让它突然全线触发。判断依据应当来自调用方的使用方式，而不是分析团队自己的判断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>洞察一旦对外提供就是数据服务，必须遵守稳定契约、口径显式、版本演进三条约束。</li>\n<li>用 OpenAPI 3.2.1 描述服务，驱动客户端生成与破坏性变更检测。</li>\n<li>聚合口径（分母、时间窗、是否含水军）必须作为字段回传，不能藏在实现里。</li>\n<li>指标必须与样本量一起返回；抑制状态用显式字段而非缺失表达。</li>\n<li>分位数用 <code>percentile_disc</code> 还是 <code>percentile_cont</code> 取决于是否需要真实存在的值；分位数不可跨实例平均。</li>\n<li>用 OpenLineage 的 RunEvent/JobEvent 建模血缘，支持影响范围分析与对外透明度声明。</li>\n<li>若洞察影响排序或推荐，需满足 DSA 第 27 条对推荐系统主要参数的披露要求。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"洞察报告与数据服务","id":"洞察报告与数据服务"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"报表与数据服务的区别","id":"报表与数据服务的区别"},{"level":2,"text":"服务契约与 OpenAPI","id":"服务契约与-openapi"},{"level":3,"text":"用 OpenAPI 描述契约","id":"用-openapi-描述契约"},{"level":3,"text":"口径、样本量与抑制状态","id":"口径-样本量与抑制状态"},{"level":2,"text":"分位数与聚合的工程细节","id":"分位数与聚合的工程细节"},{"level":3,"text":"cont 与 disc 的语义差异","id":"cont-与-disc-的语义差异"},{"level":3,"text":"分位数不可跨实例平均","id":"分位数不可跨实例平均"},{"level":2,"text":"上游变更的血缘追踪","id":"上游变更的血缘追踪"},{"level":3,"text":"用 OpenLineage 建模血缘","id":"用-openlineage-建模血缘"},{"level":3,"text":"版本演进的兼容判断","id":"版本演进的兼容判断"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"洞察人工校验与置信度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/review-text-insight-analytics/insight-quality-report/insight-validation-human"},"next":{"title":"分析合规与聚合匿名化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/review-text-insight-analytics/insight-quality-report/insight-privacy-aggregate"}}